jours ouvrés</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"trust-badges__item\">\n    <div class=\"trust-badges__icon\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n        <path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"trust-badges__text\">\n      Support client\n      <span class=\"trust-badges__sub\">7j/7 en français</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"trust-badges__item trust-badges__item--full\">\n    <div class=\"trust-badges__icon\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n        <path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path>\n        <path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"></path>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"trust-badges__text\">\n      Garantie 24 mois\n      <span class=\"trust-badges__sub\">remplacement ou remboursement</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</div>",
